   351	Dataset.The dataset is organized across 4 countries (KO,
   352	JA, TH, KM) × 12 categories × {DT, CA} conditions, with
   353	500 prompts per country (one set each of DT and CA, with
   354	1:1 seed matching).
   355	Target Models.We select four multilingual open-
   356	source LLM in the 7–12B parameter range with
   357	high practical utility in real-world deployment: meta-
   358	llama/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct (Grattafiori et al., 2024),
   359	Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct (Qwen Team, 2024), LGAI-
   360	EXAONE/EXAONE-3.5-7.8B-Instruct (LG AI Research,
   361	2024), and google/Gemma-3-12B-it (Gemma Team, Google
   362	DeepMind, 2025). The 7–12B range represents a regime
   363	in which practical deployability and academic reproducibil-
   364	ity are well balanced; the inclusion of four major model
   365	families—Meta, Alibaba, LG, and Google—reflects diver-
   366	sity in safety alignment strategies.
   367	Prompt Generation and Evaluation Models.
   368	google/gemini-2.5-pro was used for DT/CA prompt
   369	generation across all countries; GPT-4.1 was used for ASR
   370	judgment and automated Cultural Realism scoring.
   371	4.2. Overall ASR Results (RQ1)
   372	The most salient finding in Table 2 is that ∆ASR>0 is
   373	observed across all 16 language × model combinations.
   374	∆ASR ranges from +2.6 pp (KM × EXAONE) to +18.6
   375	pp (KM × Gemma), with a mean ∆ASR of +9.3 pp. The
   376	consistent elevation of ASR under CA relative to DT across
   377	all model–language combinations suggests that culturally-
   378	adapted data universally provides a novel attack vector ca-
   379	pable of bypassing existing safety filters.
   380	Language-level patterns.Mean ∆ASR by language is TH
   381	+11.8> KO +9.1> KM +8.5> JA +7.9; all four countries
   382	exceed +7 pp, with a cross-language spread of only ≈4
   383	pp. This indicates that the effect is a universal pattern not
   384	confined to any particular language.
   385	Model-level patterns.Mean ∆ASR by model follows the
   386	order Gemma +14.95> EXAONE +8.33> Qwen +7.39>
