   341	noise and ensure dataset quality. After cleaning, a total of
   342	2,123 conversations were retained and annotated by both
   343	a human annotator and additional LLMs, constituting the
   344	final AICompanionBench dataset.
   345	For human annotation, a trained annotator (a native En-
   346	glish speaker over age 21) independently reviewed each
   347	conversation and assigned the most probable category
   348	among the nine, producing the initial human labels. For
   349	machine annotation, building on the earlier LLM-based
   350	filtering stage, all 2,123 conversations have been eval-
