   354	closed-source families—GPT, Mistral, DeepSeek, and
   355	Claude—along with two additional 30B models from
   356	Qwen3. Using the same prompt in previous step, we
   357	varied only the underlying model to examine differences
   358	in safety judgments. Each conversation was therefore
   359	evaluated by 20 LLMs. For every conversation, we ex-
