   378	C. Benchmark Evaluation
   379	AICompanionBench serves as a standardized benchmark
   380	for evaluating LLMs’ safety-judging capabilities. The final-
   381	ized ground-truth labels enable systematic and comparable
   382	evaluation across different models. We compare each LLM’s
