   669	recognising and exploring risk. The panel therefore reviewed broad professional competency
   670	frameworks and ethical guidance from the British Psychological Society, American Psychological
   671	Association, Health and Care Professions Council, and UK Council for Psychotherapy. These
   672	sources informed the selection of the benchmark’s core domains of competence and ensured that
