   543	excludes multi-turn conversational dynamics in which risk may emerge gradually, as well as through
   544	multimodal inputs/outputs. The benchmark intentionally excludes prompts targeting child sexual
   545	abuse material (CSAM), which is addressed by existing evaluation frameworks. CAREBench solely
   546	evaluatesunder-refusal: every prompt represents a case where a responsibly developed model should
   547	decline or redirect. The benchmark only covers the English language, and extending it to other
   548	languages is a priority for future work.
