+Actual auditor: **Codex; model: GPT-6**, as identified in this session. Audit tools: local shell, Python/pypdf text extraction, and direct inspection of the supplied Markdown and PDF passages. No reviewer sub-agents were used. The builder's four scouts are evidence provenance, not independent auditors for this report.
+
+**Recommendation: AWAITING_PI.** V2 substantially repairs the pitch: localization is now a domain replication; human-grounded judging and collapse/recovery are acknowledged precedents; the primary claim is a falsifiable measurement proposal. Five prior findings are resolved at the S1 claim-description level. F-r001-1 is partially resolved because several full-text exclusions and validation attributions remain incorrect or incomplete. F-r001-5 remains OPEN by design: contribution importance and the warranted measurement claim require PI decisions. No checked passage establishes the exact proposed independent-practitioner, held-out incremental-validity result. This is neither proof of novelty nor an outcome-changing anticipation of the complete proposal.
+
+**Scope, inputs, and citation key**
+
+This is the one-run, non-interactive audit requested in [AUDIT_REQUEST.md](/home/wjeong/adol/audit/r002/AUDIT_REQUEST.md). The fixed closest three and five runners-up were retained. This report evaluates the supplied v2 justification, not an implemented benchmark or a completed experiment.
